-- ============================================================
-- QUICK REFERENCE TABLE
-- ============================================================
-- | Element      | Method                             | Returns  |
-- |--------------|------------------------------------|----------|
-- | Tab          | Window:CreateTab("Name")           | Tab      |
-- | Section      | Tab:CreateSection("Title")         | Frame    |
-- | Button       | Tab:CreateButton({...})            | Object   |
-- | Toggle       | Tab:CreateToggle({...})            | Object   |
-- | Slider       | Tab:CreateSlider({...})            | Object   |
-- | TextBox      | Tab:CreateTextBox({...})           | Object   |
-- | Dropdown     | Tab:CreateDropdown({...})          | Object   |
-- | ColorPicker  | Tab:CreateColorPicker({...})       | Object   |
-- | Keybind      | Tab:CreateKeybind({...})           | Object   |
-- | FontPicker   | Tab:CreateFontPicker({...})        | Object   |
-- | ThemePreset  | Tab:CreateThemePreset({...})       | Object   |
-- | Label        | Tab:CreateLabel("text")            | Object   |
-- | Notification | Window:Notify({...})               | Frame    |
